### Books - Book club endpoints
### Run each request by clicking the ▶ next to "###" (Android Studio / IntelliJ).
### Create users first (users.http) to use as admin/members.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### List all book clubs
GET {{host}}/api/book-clubs
Accept: application/json

### Get a book club by id
GET {{host}}/api/book-clubs/1
Accept: application/json

### Create a book club (201) - adminId and visibility are required
POST {{host}}/api/book-clubs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Science Fiction Club",
  "adminId": 1,
  "memberIds": [1, 2],
  "image": "https://example.com/sci-fi.png",
  "description": "Monthly discussions about science fiction classics.",
  "visibility": "PUBLIC"
}

### Create a private book club
POST {{host}}/api/book-clubs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Secret Club",
  "adminId": 1,
  "memberIds": [],
  "visibility": "PRIVATE"
}

### Update a book club (200)
PUT {{host}}/api/book-clubs/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Science Fiction Club (updated)",
  "adminId": 1,
  "memberIds": [1],
  "description": "New description.",
  "visibility": "PRIVATE"
}

### Create with a non-existent admin (404)
POST {{host}}/api/book-clubs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Invalid Club",
  "adminId": 9999,
  "visibility": "PUBLIC"
}

### Invalid create (400 - empty name + missing adminId/visibility)
POST {{host}}/api/book-clubs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "memberIds": []
}

### Delete a book club (204)
DELETE {{host}}/api/book-clubs/1
